(2635435, 365476, 59754, '<td valign="top">I''m the kind of person who goes "ooh! colors!".  That means that with just a 10 or 20 point saturation (or color boost), the sunset would have "wowed" me a lot more.<br/> <br/>That being said, great pic.  Good lines, nice composure. 7</td>', 'I''m the kind of person who goes "ooh! colors!".  That means that with just a 10 or 20 point saturation (or color boost), the sunset would have "wowed" me a lot more. That being said, great pic.  Good lines, nice composure. 7', '2006-07-19 02:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2635450, 362878, 48228, '<td valign="top">Yes, I really like this effect..... I think you know that, as this is a great example of backlighting, or actual lighting from within.....</td>', 'Yes, I really like this effect..... I think you know that, as this is a great example of backlighting, or actual lighting from within.....', '2006-07-19 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
