(2635502, 366119, 59754, '<td valign="top">The color noise and blue fringing apparent in this picture bothers me a bit, but aside from pixel-peeping I think its a great shot.  A bit more contrast would have made this easier to look at.</td>', 'The color noise and blue fringing apparent in this picture bothers me a bit, but aside from pixel-peeping I think its a great shot.  A bit more contrast would have made this easier to look at.', '2006-07-19 02:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
