(2638687, 364972, 37893, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful and as a thumbnail, it''s striking. The hot spots near the lower right might be a bear for most but it''s insignificant in this beauty of an image. Simplicity definitely has its rewards. (8)</td>', 'The colors are beautiful and as a thumbnail, it''s striking. The hot spots near the lower right might be a bear for most but it''s insignificant in this beauty of an image. Simplicity definitely has its rewards. (8)', '2006-07-19 17:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
