(2638702, 365002, 37893, '<td valign="top">The colors you''ve chosen here leaves me breathless. The image is very DPC friendly and the center is properly placed using the thirds. The only pitfall IMHO is the use of the  black border. A bit too much IMHO. (8)</td>', 'The colors you''ve chosen here leaves me breathless. The image is very DPC friendly and the center is properly placed using the thirds. The only pitfall IMHO is the use of the  black border. A bit too much IMHO. (8)', '2006-07-19 17:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
