(2639036, 365108, 27164, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge for sure.  But in my mind, it''s too busy with a composition that looks random.  There''s nothing for my eyes to rest on amid the chaos.  My advice - next time, try to "focus in" more on a single subject.  Make your composition more meaningful.</td>', 'This fits the challenge for sure.  But in my mind, it''s too busy with a composition that looks random.  There''s nothing for my eyes to rest on amid the chaos.  My advice - next time, try to "focus in" more on a single subject.  Make your composition more meaningful.', '2006-07-19 18:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639044, 365264, 27164, '<td valign="top">Awesome symmetry and point of view, shots like these are hard to get right-on.  Congrats!</td>', 'Awesome symmetry and point of view, shots like these are hard to get right-on.  Congrats!', '2006-07-19 18:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
