(2639052, 366142, 46314, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea, but somehow it just doesn''t work for me. The barb-wire seems to clutter the image. But I still like the idea of juxtaposing those harsh barbwire lines over the pristine lines of the bridge. <br/>I don''t know if changing the angle of the shot might have improved it - like taking from a higher angle, so that the barbwire is below the bridge, and not covering the bridge?</td>', 'It''s a nice idea, but somehow it just doesn''t work for me. The barb-wire seems to clutter the image. But I still like the idea of juxtaposing those harsh barbwire lines over the pristine lines of the bridge. I don''t know if changing the angle of the shot might have improved it - like taking from a higher angle, so that the barbwire is below the bridge, and not covering the bridge?', '2006-07-19 18:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639053, 365093, 27164, '<td valign="top">I love how the bridge fades into mist.  This is a lovely b/w that would make an excellent print.  Congrats on such an excellent photo.</td>', 'I love how the bridge fades into mist.  This is a lovely b/w that would make an excellent print.  Congrats on such an excellent photo.', '2006-07-19 18:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
