(2639224, 363150, 27164, '<td valign="top">This is a really great photo with a lot of potential.  Personally, I would have converted to b/w because the color is so subtle that it almost distracts.  I would have sharpened it a bit more, too, because the image appers too soft.  The composition is strong and I like the point of view, I just feel this is lacking in the post-processing area.</td>', 'This is a really great photo with a lot of potential.  Personally, I would have converted to b/w because the color is so subtle that it almost distracts.  I would have sharpened it a bit more, too, because the image appers too soft.  The composition is strong and I like the point of view, I just feel this is lacking in the post-processing area.', '2006-07-19 18:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639231, 362935, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever shot. I like the way the out of focus face in the background provides a context for the thumb image. I just wish you hadn''t cropped the thumb so tight - might have been slightly more balanced if the whole thumb was in the frame( with some black space around it).</td>', 'Clever shot. I like the way the out of focus face in the background provides a context for the thumb image. I just wish you hadn''t cropped the thumb so tight - might have been slightly more balanced if the whole thumb was in the frame( with some black space around it).', '2006-07-19 18:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639238, 364043, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat way to show depth.  But overall, it is a bit uninteresting.  It doesnt engage me emotionally at all.  Maybe you could see what it looks like in B&amp;W with a higher contrast.  That sometimes really brings out the patterns of wood grain in a dramatic way.</td>', 'Neat way to show depth.  But overall, it is a bit uninteresting.  It doesnt engage me emotionally at all.  Maybe you could see what it looks like in B&W with a higher contrast.  That sometimes really brings out the patterns of wood grain in a dramatic way.', '2006-07-19 18:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
