(2639258, 365256, 37252, '<td valign="top">the highlights are blown a bit - making the lines on the tower disappear in places. I wish you would have included the top of the tower also. The perspective makes this interesting - but the missing top really makes me feel robbed of the full view</td>', 'the highlights are blown a bit - making the lines on the tower disappear in places. I wish you would have included the top of the tower also. The perspective makes this interesting - but the missing top really makes me feel robbed of the full view', '2006-07-19 18:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
