(2639822, 365854, 61138, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and nice angle. It''s too bad the markers weren''t all facing the same way. It might have enhanced the visual rhythm.</td>', 'Nice concept and nice angle. It''s too bad the markers weren''t all facing the same way. It might have enhanced the visual rhythm.', '2006-07-19 21:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639828, 363286, 61138, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great subject. Feels too dark on the left, though. Maybe a small fill or an eye light would have helped?</td>', 'Nice composition and great subject. Feels too dark on the left, though. Maybe a small fill or an eye light would have helped?', '2006-07-19 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639832, 364201, 60370, '<td valign="top">My eyes go to glossy lips, not the lines.  Still, very nice photo.</td>', 'My eyes go to glossy lips, not the lines.  Still, very nice photo.', '2006-07-19 21:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639847, 366159, 51802, '<td valign="top">I think the rainbow is a little over processed.  It has gone past the point of looking real, and now looks computer generated.</td>', 'I think the rainbow is a little over processed.  It has gone past the point of looking real, and now looks computer generated.', '2006-07-19 21:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639850, 365372, 61138, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Out of context, these things almost look alien. The colour gradient is very pretty.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Out of context, these things almost look alien. The colour gradient is very pretty.', '2006-07-19 21:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639852, 365077, 60370, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2006-07-19 21:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639855, 366159, 61138, '<td valign="top">Is that Alberta? The Three Sisters maybe? Great capture. I''ve never seen a brighter rainbow.</td>', 'Is that Alberta? The Three Sisters maybe? Great capture. I''ve never seen a brighter rainbow.', '2006-07-19 21:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639894, 365104, 51802, '<td valign="top">Took me several seconds to figure out what I was looking at.  Well done!</td>', 'Took me several seconds to figure out what I was looking at.  Well done!', '2006-07-19 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639897, 365343, 58184, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-07-19 21:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639898, 363282, 51802, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC!  One thing you shold always do is make sure you use the full size available to you when submitting a picture.  People will generally score quite low for smaller shots.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC!  One thing you shold always do is make sure you use the full size available to you when submitting a picture.  People will generally score quite low for smaller shots.', '2006-07-19 21:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639902, 364542, 42957, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2006-07-19 21:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639909, 365956, 42957, '<td valign="top">Cute and very creative!  My only gripe is that the paper is a bit too gray; I think the image would pop more if it was slightly brighter.</td>', 'Cute and very creative!  My only gripe is that the paper is a bit too gray; I think the image would pop more if it was slightly brighter.', '2006-07-19 21:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639916, 364998, 58184, '<td valign="top">Everywhere I look on her... i see lines.  Nice job!</td>', 'Everywhere I look on her... i see lines.  Nice job!', '2006-07-19 21:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639919, 365525, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice heavenly rays on the mottled landscape.  It could be sand, or cloth, or a body......  Nice.</td>', 'Nice heavenly rays on the mottled landscape.  It could be sand, or cloth, or a body......  Nice.', '2006-07-19 21:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639921, 365471, 33889, '<td valign="top">With such a beautiful model and a great idea, you could have been more creative with your lighting and composition to come up with a winner.  The lighting is dead-on and flat.  She is too close to the background and the depth of field is one dimensional.  You could have used all these elements to make your photo more interesting.</td>', 'With such a beautiful model and a great idea, you could have been more creative with your lighting and composition to come up with a winner.  The lighting is dead-on and flat.  She is too close to the background and the depth of field is one dimensional.  You could have used all these elements to make your photo more interesting.', '2006-07-19 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639922, 363530, 58452, '<td valign="top">Lovely interference patterns and composition.</td>', 'Lovely interference patterns and composition.', '2006-07-19 21:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639925, 363430, 36499, '<td valign="top">very creative and unique entry...good luck!</td>', 'very creative and unique entry...good luck!', '2006-07-19 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639926, 365577, 42957, '<td valign="top">National Geographic-esque.  I like it!</td>', 'National Geographic-esque.  I like it!', '2006-07-19 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639930, 363769, 58452, '<td valign="top">Something draws the eye to the dirty white pattern. The red brick really sets it off.  Nice</td>', 'Something draws the eye to the dirty white pattern. The red brick really sets it off.  Nice', '2006-07-19 21:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639931, 365273, 42957, '<td valign="top">Nice focus!   That''s lovely bokeh, and great composition!</td>', 'Nice focus!   That''s lovely bokeh, and great composition!', '2006-07-19 21:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639933, 365340, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the bullethole light thru effect.  Nice composition too.</td>', 'I like the bullethole light thru effect.  Nice composition too.', '2006-07-19 21:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639934, 364387, 42957, '<td valign="top">The border adds a lot.</td>', 'The border adds a lot.', '2006-07-19 21:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639939, 365841, 42957, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. Trippy.</td>', 'Ooooh. Trippy.', '2006-07-19 21:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639940, 365550, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the subtle shades and shadows.</td>', 'Love the subtle shades and shadows.', '2006-07-19 21:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639946, 365262, 58452, '<td valign="top">Looked at it two more times after voting for all and decided to upgrade to an 8.  The exposure of the face with the lines on the shades is superb.</td>', 'Looked at it two more times after voting for all and decided to upgrade to an 8.  The exposure of the face with the lines on the shades is superb.', '2006-07-19 21:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639949, 363522, 33889, '<td valign="top">Good times, good times... a shame I can''t remember them.</td>', 'Good times, good times... a shame I can''t remember them.', '2006-07-19 21:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639950, 366125, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the glow of color in the top left frame.</td>', 'Love the glow of color in the top left frame.', '2006-07-19 21:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639954, 364980, 42957, '<td valign="top">Wow! Those are intricate lines!</td>', 'Wow! Those are intricate lines!', '2006-07-19 21:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639960, 363150, 42957, '<td valign="top">Dig the low satch.</td>', 'Dig the low satch.', '2006-07-19 21:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639963, 366211, 42957, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool body.</td>', 'That''s a cool body.', '2006-07-19 21:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639969, 365264, 58452, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like any type of power line support as a subject.  But... this one with the sky you captured makes the frame looked like stained glass.  If the top center of the sky hadn''t been so hot this would have been an 8.  Nice.</td>', 'I don''t usually like any type of power line support as a subject.  But... this one with the sky you captured makes the frame looked like stained glass.  If the top center of the sky hadn''t been so hot this would have been an 8.  Nice.', '2006-07-19 21:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639970, 365476, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the pale salmon glow on the horizon.</td>', 'Love the pale salmon glow on the horizon.', '2006-07-19 21:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639973, 365620, 58452, '<td valign="top">These lines are sharp enough to cut.</td>', 'These lines are sharp enough to cut.', '2006-07-19 21:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639974, 365907, 42957, '<td valign="top">There''s another hand photo extremely similar to this.  Hmmm.  What''s going on?</td>', 'There''s another hand photo extremely similar to this.  Hmmm.  What''s going on?', '2006-07-19 21:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639975, 363224, 42957, '<td valign="top">Aww man that''s sad.</td>', 'Aww man that''s sad.', '2006-07-19 21:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639981, 365644, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the sweeping composition with the evening light.  Wish the curve could have been closer to the light house and the sky more flaming.  The windmills don''t do much for me either.</td>', 'Love the sweeping composition with the evening light.  Wish the curve could have been closer to the light house and the sky more flaming.  The windmills don''t do much for me either.', '2006-07-19 21:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639982, 365644, 42957, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color.  The windmills on the left are lovely.  And the sky--beautiful.  Bet the DPC''ers are totally loving it.</td>', 'Great composition and color.  The windmills on the left are lovely.  And the sky--beautiful.  Bet the DPC''ers are totally loving it.', '2006-07-19 21:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639986, 364933, 42957, '<td valign="top">Oooh--visual illusion!  It looks like a trapeziod.</td>', 'Oooh--visual illusion!  It looks like a trapeziod.', '2006-07-19 21:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2639987, 363762, 58452, '<td valign="top">I don''t like power line supports but...... you''ve done a darn fine job of making this one look like a hulking dangerous alien.  Nice.</td>', 'I don''t like power line supports but...... you''ve done a darn fine job of making this one look like a hulking dangerous alien.  Nice.', '2006-07-19 21:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
