(2640175, 364629, 41008, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll probably hear people complain saying that this ought to be sharper, but I like it veyr much as it is.</td>', 'I think you''ll probably hear people complain saying that this ought to be sharper, but I like it veyr much as it is.', '2006-07-19 22:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
