(2640201, 366147, 41008, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous. Too bad about that bright spot on the second rail from the right. Still, this gets a high score from me.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous. Too bad about that bright spot on the second rail from the right. Still, this gets a high score from me.', '2006-07-19 22:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
