(2640214, 364915, 41008, '<td valign="top">Brilliant car... I''ve seen the 901 ;)<br/> <br/>I like the composition a lot. I''m not sure if non-car-buffs will be as appreciative of this, though.</td>', 'Brilliant car... I''ve seen the 901 ;) I like the composition a lot. I''m not sure if non-car-buffs will be as appreciative of this, though.', '2006-07-19 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
