(2640693, 365305, 62249, '<td valign="top">I really like the angled viewpoint. wish the tower had more tonal range but hard to keep the bridge detail at the same time.</td>', 'I really like the angled viewpoint. wish the tower had more tonal range but hard to keep the bridge detail at the same time.', '2006-07-20 00:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
