(2642213, 363821, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like your idea but feel that you have lost a lot of detail.  I think that is the result of two problems.  First - your focus is not quite spot on and second - the backgroud behind the web is too busy.  Try placing a black card behind the web next time.  Keep up the good work - I can''t wait to see your next submission.</td>', 'I like your idea but feel that you have lost a lot of detail.  I think that is the result of two problems.  First - your focus is not quite spot on and second - the backgroud behind the web is too busy.  Try placing a black card behind the web next time.  Keep up the good work - I can''t wait to see your next submission.', '2006-07-20 12:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2642225, 364717, 61348, '<td valign="top">nice picture<br/>the chair is in a disturbing place of the picture <br/>Maybe centered between the 2 doors should have been better?</td>', 'nice picturethe chair is in a disturbing place of the picture Maybe centered between the 2 doors should have been better?', '2006-07-20 12:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2642231, 365402, 55746, '<td valign="top">I really like the coloring and the mood of your photo.  I do feel that the lighting on the floor and coming through the window are too harsh and it has caused you to loose the line detail you were shooting for to meet the challenge.  I also find the light switches pull my eye to them and there are a couple of satellites to the left of the window - however, I love how the door frame pops.   Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I really like the coloring and the mood of your photo.  I do feel that the lighting on the floor and coming through the window are too harsh and it has caused you to loose the line detail you were shooting for to meet the challenge.  I also find the light switches pull my eye to them and there are a couple of satellites to the left of the window - however, I love how the door frame pops.   Keep up the good work.', '2006-07-20 12:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2642242, 364664, 61348, '<td valign="top">nice picture <br/>The green plant in the lower left is a bit disturbing</td>', 'nice picture The green plant in the lower left is a bit disturbing', '2006-07-20 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2642261, 363430, 47534, '<td valign="top">Someone worked very hard on this, and it shows!!!  very good job - I hope it places high for you!</td>', 'Someone worked very hard on this, and it shows!!!  very good job - I hope it places high for you!', '2006-07-20 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2642269, 364233, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like your idea.  I think two things could improve your photo - more detail in the converging lines and to have the words on the sheet rock right side up.  Your lighting is very well done.</td>', 'I like your idea.  I think two things could improve your photo - more detail in the converging lines and to have the words on the sheet rock right side up.  Your lighting is very well done.', '2006-07-20 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
