(2642335, 364108, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition!  Very nice use of perspective (this would have been good in the Perspective Challenge, too), and of light and shadow.</td>', 'Very interesting composition!  Very nice use of perspective (this would have been good in the Perspective Challenge, too), and of light and shadow.', '2006-07-20 13:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
