(2647785, 364303, 39919, '<td valign="top">I am not quite sure which lines I am supposed to be looking at here (the lines on the shorts, the butt crack, the lines of his hand, or the hairy lines).  Consequently, my eye is jumping all over the picture such that it makes it impossible to even look at the whole thing.  And if I try to "step back" and look a the whole thing, I don''t see any lines at all, just a rather uninteresting picture of a hairy ass guy with his pants falling down (so his hands should be else...like pulling them up).</td>', 'I am not quite sure which lines I am supposed to be looking at here (the lines on the shorts, the butt crack, the lines of his hand, or the hairy lines).  Consequently, my eye is jumping all over the picture such that it makes it impossible to even look at the whole thing.  And if I try to "step back" and look a the whole thing, I don''t see any lines at all, just a rather uninteresting picture of a hairy ass guy with his pants falling down (so his hands should be else...like pulling them up).', '2006-07-22 00:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
