(2648836, 365575, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflections and a sweet rural scene with a lovely line of trees as well as the lovely sweeping curve of the river. The two anglers are really interesting and of course their rods create lines too. Personally I think they are a little too small or too near to the edge of the image - perhaps they fade into the image because it''s in black and white? I think I''d like to see more made of them as they are such a great potential focal point.</td>', 'Lovely reflections and a sweet rural scene with a lovely line of trees as well as the lovely sweeping curve of the river. The two anglers are really interesting and of course their rods create lines too. Personally I think they are a little too small or too near to the edge of the image - perhaps they fade into the image because it''s in black and white? I think I''d like to see more made of them as they are such a great potential focal point.', '2006-07-22 14:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2648839, 364108, 3087, '<td valign="top">This really is a masterpiece! It''s so stark, so wonderfully high in contrast and so powerful in it''s composition too. I really like the sitting figure though the two walkers are of course integral too. Just a fantastic use of light and shadow, a fantastic eye for composition and beautifully executed too. I love it!</td>', 'This really is a masterpiece! It''s so stark, so wonderfully high in contrast and so powerful in it''s composition too. I really like the sitting figure though the two walkers are of course integral too. Just a fantastic use of light and shadow, a fantastic eye for composition and beautifully executed too. I love it!', '2006-07-22 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
