(2648918, 365105, 39598, '<td valign="top">This picture suffers from over-sharpening.<br/>Then, your subject''s nose looks like it''s been blurred.<br/>The tone is great, with good contrast between your shadows and highlights, leaving your image neither under-exposed, nor over-exposed, while conveying mood and drama.<br/>I like the highlights in her eyes too.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'This picture suffers from over-sharpening.Then, your subject''s nose looks like it''s been blurred.The tone is great, with good contrast between your shadows and highlights, leaving your image neither under-exposed, nor over-exposed, while conveying mood and drama.I like the highlights in her eyes too.Good luck!', '2006-07-22 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
