(2648939, 365056, 60370, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I have a preset notion of what a picture like this should look like though.  In-focus clouds on the horizon, backlit by the sun (setting or not, it doesn''t matter).  This looks like just a part in the clouds where the sun is shining through.</td>', 'Nice idea, I have a preset notion of what a picture like this should look like though.  In-focus clouds on the horizon, backlit by the sun (setting or not, it doesn''t matter).  This looks like just a part in the clouds where the sun is shining through.', '2006-07-22 15:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
