(2649730, 364801, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your subject is infinitely more interesting than most entries but your problem here is one of creativity - there is none so it won''t score well. If you were able to get closer then an abstract view of this would be much more impactful and look more thoughtful than this snapshot, but I understand why getting nearer to these might be quite painful!</td>', 'Your subject is infinitely more interesting than most entries but your problem here is one of creativity - there is none so it won''t score well. If you were able to get closer then an abstract view of this would be much more impactful and look more thoughtful than this snapshot, but I understand why getting nearer to these might be quite painful!', '2006-07-22 20:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2649741, 363885, 29513, '<td valign="top">I love this time lapse effect.  I like the turn signals and lane changes.  Did you experiment with appature at all to try and not over expose the headlight?  Might be interesting.</td>', 'I love this time lapse effect.  I like the turn signals and lane changes.  Did you experiment with appature at all to try and not over expose the headlight?  Might be interesting.', '2006-07-22 20:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
