(2658210, 366004, 54778, '<td valign="top">A very lovely subject. I''m guessing you zoomed in since the detail and sharpness is a tiny bit missing. To improve this shot I would suggest you saturate this pic and get rid of the browns. With the more b/w touch it would have been more striking with the contrast bewteen b/w and the border would have been black (yes the colour of border doesn''t do much for me even though I appreciate the the fact that you were trying to frame the pic rightfully so)<br/>Good Luck!</td>', 'A very lovely subject. I''m guessing you zoomed in since the detail and sharpness is a tiny bit missing. To improve this shot I would suggest you saturate this pic and get rid of the browns. With the more b/w touch it would have been more striking with the contrast bewteen b/w and the border would have been black (yes the colour of border doesn''t do much for me even though I appreciate the the fact that you were trying to frame the pic rightfully so)Good Luck!', '2006-07-25 11:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
