(2659158, 366180, 50695, '<td valign="top">It seems like these windows have a personality, since a personality can be judged by what we see and how we see. Clearly, these windows are fun at a party, like to have a good time. Look how skewed their vision is! Look how playful they are, not allowing things to match with what''s next to them, tilting and scrunching them. So we see not just a funhouse city, but we also imagine the soul that imagines it (which could also be called you, the photographer). 7</td>', 'It seems like these windows have a personality, since a personality can be judged by what we see and how we see. Clearly, these windows are fun at a party, like to have a good time. Look how skewed their vision is! Look how playful they are, not allowing things to match with what''s next to them, tilting and scrunching them. So we see not just a funhouse city, but we also imagine the soul that imagines it (which could also be called you, the photographer). 7', '2006-07-25 16:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
