(2660482, 364717, 52336, '<td valign="top">Quite gorgeous composition for this challenge, as there are so many lines to consider: those between the floorboards, in the walls, the window panes, the bench, all the wood grain, and the angled lines in the chairs.  I quite like how the eye is drawn through to the centre of the image, and how the nested rooms add almost a bit of mystery that make us want to know what else might be going on here.  My only criticism would be regarding the saturation.  For me, perhaps using Curves to add a bit more depth and contrast to the colours and shadows would have enhanced what I see as a kind of relaxing mystery.  In any event, a great photo.  And I just checked - what an awesome placement!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Quite gorgeous composition for this challenge, as there are so many lines to consider: those between the floorboards, in the walls, the window panes, the bench, all the wood grain, and the angled lines in the chairs.  I quite like how the eye is drawn through to the centre of the image, and how the nested rooms add almost a bit of mystery that make us want to know what else might be going on here.  My only criticism would be regarding the saturation.  For me, perhaps using Curves to add a bit more depth and contrast to the colours and shadows would have enhanced what I see as a kind of relaxing mystery.  In any event, a great photo.  And I just checked - what an awesome placement!  Congratulations!', '2006-07-26 01:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2660502, 365755, 19708, '<td valign="top">102nd???<br/>Huh?<br/>This is so deserving of a much higher finish.</td>', '102nd???Huh?This is so deserving of a much higher finish.', '2006-07-26 01:41:44.000000', NULL, 0),
