(2660558, 364980, 62273, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments. I am happy that I scored a good above 5 in my first submission.<br/> <br/>Mhendi is herb when applied leaves a a drak color which stays for weeks. Mhendi is used on many (should say all) Auspicious ocassions in India.<br/> <br/>Well here my friend is getting married and the groom has got his hands beautifull decorated with Mhendi.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments. I am happy that I scored a good above 5 in my first submission. Mhendi is herb when applied leaves a a drak color which stays for weeks. Mhendi is used on many (should say all) Auspicious ocassions in India. Well here my friend is getting married and the groom has got his hands beautifull decorated with Mhendi.', '2006-07-26 01:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
