(2660835, 363790, 48890, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all who commented!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ShutterPug:</b></div><hr/><i> nice angles - good perspective. Seems a bit flat though </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I get this "flat" complaint all the time.  This image was *meant* to be 2-dimentional.  What''s wrong with that?  See discussion under this picture for more thoughts on flatness:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=306215" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48890/thumb/306215.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48890/thumb/306215.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48890/thumb/306215.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-26 01:36:15.</i></td>', 'Thank you to all who commented! Originally posted by ShutterPug: nice angles - good perspective. Seems a bit flat though  I get this "flat" complaint all the time.  This image was *meant* to be 2-dimentional.  What''s wrong with that?  See discussion under this picture for more thoughts on flatness:', '2006-07-26 02:34:27.000000', '2006-07-26 02:36:15.000000', 0),
