(2660865, 363790, 19708, '<td valign="top">Actually, there is more dimension than you give yourself credit Arcady.<br/>The longer I sit and look at this, the more I begin to think or see the one side with the left arrow, being on a higher plane than the lower section with the right arrow. Not until the far left side of the image do they seem to have the same lighting and share the same plane.<br/>Great use of shades to add an etxra touch of dimension.</td>', 'Actually, there is more dimension than you give yourself credit Arcady.The longer I sit and look at this, the more I begin to think or see the one side with the left arrow, being on a higher plane than the lower section with the right arrow. Not until the far left side of the image do they seem to have the same lighting and share the same plane.Great use of shades to add an etxra touch of dimension.', '2006-07-26 02:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
