(2661266, 364439, 57358, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very beautiful shot, a bit hard to tell which part of the body it is at first, but the skin and the black cord are perfectly soft and the colors are spot on...  I''d also agree with everything photoheathen said</td>', 'I thought this was a very beautiful shot, a bit hard to tell which part of the body it is at first, but the skin and the black cord are perfectly soft and the colors are spot on...  I''d also agree with everything photoheathen said', '2006-07-26 03:32:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2661274, 364439, 41337, '<td valign="top">I agree with Art. The lighting is good and if you really like this then that''s all that matters. For me, I really couldn''t connect with the image. The lines and shapes produced here isn''t what I normally would associate with the human form. It almost feels alien like in the triangles the lines form (the elbow, the two ropes as they cross the borders, etc). If anything I like this image more for the texture of the skin and the velvety feel of the robes. Hope that helps!</td>', 'I agree with Art. The lighting is good and if you really like this then that''s all that matters. For me, I really couldn''t connect with the image. The lines and shapes produced here isn''t what I normally would associate with the human form. It almost feels alien like in the triangles the lines form (the elbow, the two ropes as they cross the borders, etc). If anything I like this image more for the texture of the skin and the velvety feel of the robes. Hope that helps!', '2006-07-26 03:33:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2661295, 365736, 93, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC.. where people''s assumptions are law.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry that something so fresh and vulnerable needed to be seen as something disturbing or horrific.<br/> <br/>Human nature maybe, but for me, there are far better ways to word things than throwing in assumptions or outright negative opinions. (aren''t attractive or something to highlight is an *extremely* subjective viewpoint.. could have been worded much more sensitively).<br/> <br/>Anyway.. I''m ranting now, but it starts to get old in this community.<br/> <br/>Cheers for having strength and courage with this shot, and showing a vulnerable moment that you obviously feel is something worth sharing.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC.. where people''s assumptions are law. I''m sorry that something so fresh and vulnerable needed to be seen as something disturbing or horrific. Human nature maybe, but for me, there are far better ways to word things than throwing in assumptions or outright negative opinions. (aren''t attractive or something to highlight is an *extremely* subjective viewpoint.. could have been worded much more sensitively). Anyway.. I''m ranting now, but it starts to get old in this community. Cheers for having strength and courage with this shot, and showing a vulnerable moment that you obviously feel is something worth sharing.', '2006-07-26 03:34:37.000000', NULL, 0),
