(2662282, 364931, 25787, '<td valign="top">I''m so excited!!!  I never thought I''d ever get a ribbon.  My second entry with my new camera.  Used a tripod and a 6 second exposure.  I wasn''t shooting for the challenge, but the ferris wheel just moved a little bit during the six seconds and gave the line appearance.  Most of my shots have the ferris wheel as a complete blur.  I''ll post the best one when I get back from my trip to Florida.  Thank you all for the votes and the comments.  Love dpc.</td>', 'I''m so excited!!!  I never thought I''d ever get a ribbon.  My second entry with my new camera.  Used a tripod and a 6 second exposure.  I wasn''t shooting for the challenge, but the ferris wheel just moved a little bit during the six seconds and gave the line appearance.  Most of my shots have the ferris wheel as a complete blur.  I''ll post the best one when I get back from my trip to Florida.  Thank you all for the votes and the comments.  Love dpc.', '2006-07-26 08:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662289, 365525, 3569, '<td valign="top">Sammie, you''re the best!!!!   We should have been there with you.  What a fantastic shot and well deserved "Blue".  Van</td>', 'Sammie, you''re the best!!!!   We should have been there with you.  What a fantastic shot and well deserved "Blue".  Van', '2006-07-26 08:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662297, 364838, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great Job RobinSong!  Not too bad for your first challenge.</td>', 'Great Job RobinSong!  Not too bad for your first challenge.', '2006-07-26 08:20:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662308, 363483, 40679, '<td valign="top">Am I right you used a tv for lighting? well, that''s very creative I must say! :)<br/> <br/>I think you tried your best to compose this shot, but it looks a bit busy at the bottom and empty in the middle. Try experiment with composition a bit more, and check out other photos, how did they do the composition?<br/> <br/>Also check out the settings you can use from your camera and experiment a bit, try to find a way to get the fucus on (faster shutterspeed) or use a different, bigger and fiercer light source.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-26 07:31:53.</i></td>', 'Am I right you used a tv for lighting? well, that''s very creative I must say! :) I think you tried your best to compose this shot, but it looks a bit busy at the bottom and empty in the middle. Try experiment with composition a bit more, and check out other photos, how did they do the composition? Also check out the settings you can use from your camera and experiment a bit, try to find a way to get the fucus on (faster shutterspeed) or use a different, bigger and fiercer light source. Hope this helps!', '2006-07-26 08:28:17.000000', '2006-07-26 08:31:53.000000', 0),
(2662329, 365525, 18349, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sammie!  I love your dune pictures and this one is  stunning, as always!  :)</td>', 'Congratulations Sammie!  I love your dune pictures and this one is  stunning, as always!  :)', '2006-07-26 08:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662330, 364035, 40679, '<td valign="top">This challenge seemed to be a we-don''t-comment-too-much-challenge.. I had the same problem ;-)<br/> <br/>Composition looks good for me, I like the way your son looks into the photo. I think I''d crop the top-part &amp; a bit of the left (bricks around waerfall) to get the feeling the waterfall is even bigger.<br/> <br/>There are lines everywhere, but the main focus is on your son. But still, I do like this photo. Nice job!</td>', 'This challenge seemed to be a we-don''t-comment-too-much-challenge.. I had the same problem ;-) Composition looks good for me, I like the way your son looks into the photo. I think I''d crop the top-part & a bit of the left (bricks around waerfall) to get the feeling the waterfall is even bigger. There are lines everywhere, but the main focus is on your son. But still, I do like this photo. Nice job!', '2006-07-26 08:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662340, 364717, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great finish!!!!!!   I love this photo!   I''m so glad it finished strong!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great finish!!!!!!   I love this photo!   I''m so glad it finished strong!! ', '2006-07-26 08:43:23.000000', NULL, 0),
