(2662507, 364610, 30049, '<td valign="top">Darn...not Virginia.  :(  <br/> <br/>Thought you were going to lead me to a new subject to check out.  ;^)  Oh well, maybe my next visit to Texas?  BTW, I didn''t vote on this - was just passing thru making comments.</td>', 'Darn...not Virginia.  :(   Thought you were going to lead me to a new subject to check out.  ;^)  Oh well, maybe my next visit to Texas?  BTW, I didn''t vote on this - was just passing thru making comments.', '2006-07-26 09:32:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662508, 365273, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7. This is not a typical neck-up giraffe shot. For some reason, this giraffe has personality. I suppose it''s the extreme gangliness and the perfectly curled tongue. And of course, something in her eyes!</td>', 'I gave this a 7. This is not a typical neck-up giraffe shot. For some reason, this giraffe has personality. I suppose it''s the extreme gangliness and the perfectly curled tongue. And of course, something in her eyes!', '2006-07-26 09:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662524, 363903, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful expressive loving children and there''s something comforting about the cubistic house and pastoral setting in the reflection.</td>', 'wonderful expressive loving children and there''s something comforting about the cubistic house and pastoral setting in the reflection.', '2006-07-26 09:35:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662533, 365937, 50695, '<td valign="top">I bet your DOF cost you points, but that''s what makes the picture so interesting. Congratulations on a daring choice.</td>', 'I bet your DOF cost you points, but that''s what makes the picture so interesting. Congratulations on a daring choice.', '2006-07-26 09:36:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662562, 364780, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful portrait. We see simultaneously the man and the mask, we see also the man as creation and the man as creator. The more I think on this picture, the more I see.</td>', 'wonderful portrait. We see simultaneously the man and the mask, we see also the man as creation and the man as creator. The more I think on this picture, the more I see.', '2006-07-26 09:39:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662582, 364971, 50695, '<td valign="top">a Zen photograph! the eye is not led anywhere, it drifts pleasantly over the whole picture, viewer is at piece with viewed. the purpose of lines is broken by fragments of leaves. In this moment you have captured, no one is walking to work. "To" and "from" have disappeared, leaving only The Way.</td>', 'a Zen photograph! the eye is not led anywhere, it drifts pleasantly over the whole picture, viewer is at piece with viewed. the purpose of lines is broken by fragments of leaves. In this moment you have captured, no one is walking to work. "To" and "from" have disappeared, leaving only The Way.', '2006-07-26 09:43:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662592, 364083, 50695, '<td valign="top">Impressive. The most moody picture of a hummingbird I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'Impressive. The most moody picture of a hummingbird I''ve ever seen.', '2006-07-26 09:45:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662599, 365372, 50695, '<td valign="top">When you see a distinctive image, a special image, you know right away. It grabs you. Imperfections seem irrelevant. This is one such image.</td>', 'When you see a distinctive image, a special image, you know right away. It grabs you. Imperfections seem irrelevant. This is one such image.', '2006-07-26 09:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662611, 365420, 50695, '<td valign="top">Caleb, I gave you an 8 for this. As well as being visually interesting and hinting at metaphorical significance, it also hints at the personality of each member of the band, like the notorious Abbey Road photo.</td>', 'Caleb, I gave you an 8 for this. As well as being visually interesting and hinting at metaphorical significance, it also hints at the personality of each member of the band, like the notorious Abbey Road photo.', '2006-07-26 09:48:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662619, 362711, 50695, '<td valign="top">Stunning picture. What I like most about it, ironically, is that the illusion is NOT interrupted.</td>', 'Stunning picture. What I like most about it, ironically, is that the illusion is NOT interrupted.', '2006-07-26 09:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662622, 366176, 8367, '<td valign="top">A unique capture (love the hair) with great composition.<br/>Tones are beautiful and the catchlights are perfect. Great job!<br/>You need to frame this one!</td>', 'A unique capture (love the hair) with great composition.Tones are beautiful and the catchlights are perfect. Great job!You need to frame this one!', '2006-07-26 09:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662625, 366147, 50695, '<td valign="top">the sunflare makes this picture for me. It makes this world seem like a fantasy world. It gives this world something to hope for.</td>', 'the sunflare makes this picture for me. It makes this world seem like a fantasy world. It gives this world something to hope for.', '2006-07-26 09:51:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662634, 365207, 50695, '<td valign="top">great eye. processing is just right. crop is just right.</td>', 'great eye. processing is just right. crop is just right.', '2006-07-26 09:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662642, 363150, 48570, '<td valign="top">Nice mood and composition.<br/>Regards, B.</td>', 'Nice mood and composition.Regards, B.', '2006-07-26 09:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
