(2662691, 364035, 50695, '<td valign="top">I adore this! Notice how the dark part of the background is behind his head and upper body, creating a "bust" of sorts. This contrasts with his body as a whole, which is dynamic and moving, as emphasized by the lines on the ground. The eye is drawn to the boy, but the boy himself is outward-directed, creating an overall dynamism to the picture. and it doesn''t hurt that he has such a kick-a$$ expression on his face. ;)</td>', 'I adore this! Notice how the dark part of the background is behind his head and upper body, creating a "bust" of sorts. This contrasts with his body as a whole, which is dynamic and moving, as emphasized by the lines on the ground. The eye is drawn to the boy, but the boy himself is outward-directed, creating an overall dynamism to the picture. and it doesn''t hurt that he has such a kick-a$$ expression on his face. ;)', '2006-07-26 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662696, 364519, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7, but I would have come back and bumped it higher if I had had time to finish voting. I just love the way she breaks up the severe geometry of the shot. Even though she is small and facing away, her impact on the picture is huge. I love such contradictions.</td>', 'I gave this a 7, but I would have come back and bumped it higher if I had had time to finish voting. I just love the way she breaks up the severe geometry of the shot. Even though she is small and facing away, her impact on the picture is huge. I love such contradictions.', '2006-07-26 10:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
