(2662793, 365938, 50695, '<td valign="top">great symmetry. I love the way this space divides into sections. For example, there are three sections beneath the benches. one contains a pair of shoes, one contains a pigeon, and one contains blissful emptiness. Also, note the symmetry of the subjects, each with the carefully angled leg. They look like statues that belong in the museum! It''s one of those images I can just sit and look at.</td>', 'great symmetry. I love the way this space divides into sections. For example, there are three sections beneath the benches. one contains a pair of shoes, one contains a pigeon, and one contains blissful emptiness. Also, note the symmetry of the subjects, each with the carefully angled leg. They look like statues that belong in the museum! It''s one of those images I can just sit and look at.', '2006-07-26 10:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662796, 364838, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice pigeon progression. Each pigeon seems to have something different to say. Good composition, too. I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Nice pigeon progression. Each pigeon seems to have something different to say. Good composition, too. I gave you a 7.', '2006-07-26 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
