(2663245, 365471, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great vulnerability to this portrait. Not only is the skin exposed, but even the veins! It is a pretense of vulnerability, of course (drawn in), but it mirrors the real deal.</td>', 'Great vulnerability to this portrait. Not only is the skin exposed, but even the veins! It is a pretense of vulnerability, of course (drawn in), but it mirrors the real deal.', '2006-07-26 11:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
