(2664269, 364108, 38032, '<td valign="top">A refreshing combination of elements: contrast, perspective, and the mundane yet somehow beautiful moments in life.  A great image with many faves already (including me)! ... Congrats.</td>', 'A refreshing combination of elements: contrast, perspective, and the mundane yet somehow beautiful moments in life.  A great image with many faves already (including me)! ... Congrats.', '2006-07-26 15:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
