(2664390, 365110, 58330, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all of you for your comments, which I find very helpful. I agree about the webs; they should have been shown better, although there is also the thrill of eventually spotting them.<br/>As you can see this is my first attempt and it has taken months to pluck up courage to enter, so thank you again for the constructive remarks. Sadly my next one is not doing well.....</td>', 'Thank you to all of you for your comments, which I find very helpful. I agree about the webs; they should have been shown better, although there is also the thrill of eventually spotting them.As you can see this is my first attempt and it has taken months to pluck up courage to enter, so thank you again for the constructive remarks. Sadly my next one is not doing well.....', '2006-07-26 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2664412, 365340, 19672, '<td valign="top">Someone must really hate guitars...they gave you a two. Nice shot...just screams Nashville!!! *lol*<br/> <br/>Of note, one aspect I didn''t like was the washed out feel in some places. I took it into photoshop and adjusted the curves and went with a bit more contrast. Then I went into HUE/Saturation and darkened the blues and increased the blue saturations. I felt this helped the shot a bit subject to taste.</td>', 'Someone must really hate guitars...they gave you a two. Nice shot...just screams Nashville!!! *lol* Of note, one aspect I didn''t like was the washed out feel in some places. I took it into photoshop and adjusted the curves and went with a bit more contrast. Then I went into HUE/Saturation and darkened the blues and increased the blue saturations. I felt this helped the shot a bit subject to taste.', '2006-07-26 16:25:16.000000', NULL, 0),
