(2664657, 364439, 27373, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Dark, lighting is great, leaves alot to the imagination- maybe too much for some people.<br/> <br/>I think one thing that may have hurt it a little in the challenge is that it is a little out of the box for lines.  Don''t get me wrong, I think it is a great entry for this challenge (certainly meets challenge), but somehow I''d bet that a few of those two''s, three''s or fours were looking for "LINES!!!" and didn''t find them here.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge- Lazy, lazy, lazy.  I would''ve probably given you an 8 on this.  In looking at the challenge there are at least 6 images that scored way too low (at the same time I see that many that think scored high).</td>', 'I like this shot.  Dark, lighting is great, leaves alot to the imagination- maybe too much for some people. I think one thing that may have hurt it a little in the challenge is that it is a little out of the box for lines.  Don''t get me wrong, I think it is a great entry for this challenge (certainly meets challenge), but somehow I''d bet that a few of those two''s, three''s or fours were looking for "LINES!!!" and didn''t find them here. I didn''t vote in this challenge- Lazy, lazy, lazy.  I would''ve probably given you an 8 on this.  In looking at the challenge there are at least 6 images that scored way too low (at the same time I see that many that think scored high).', '2006-07-26 17:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
