(2665335, 364717, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot Deb. Great lines, great perspective and the colors are just really really nice. You have been putting out some real nice work lately and this is surely one of them. A great feel overall and a well deserved placement and score. Well done!</td>', 'Great shot Deb. Great lines, great perspective and the colors are just really really nice. You have been putting out some real nice work lately and this is surely one of them. A great feel overall and a well deserved placement and score. Well done!', '2006-07-26 20:03:59.000000', NULL, 0),
