(2665478, 365396, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hi Brenda,<br/>Nice photo you have here. You have an eye for details and that''s really good. What I love about the photo is it gives a nice warmth and cozy feel in the colours.<br/> <br/>The composition is careful and proper.<br/> <br/>That''s what I felt made the photo look "normal" and ranked much lower than it is. <br/> <br/>It took a while before I associated the photo with the topic lines. And I think that I have a problem with my own photo too. Usually, the judges here would do a quick glance and place a vote especially when it''s a mega-large challenge like this one. :)<br/> <br/>You might want to post process it a little more .. just to have some fun and see if you can get a nice abstract....<br/> <br/>I did not manage vote on this challenge, but it would have been a 6 for me.. :)<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Eric</td>', 'Hi Brenda,Nice photo you have here. You have an eye for details and that''s really good. What I love about the photo is it gives a nice warmth and cozy feel in the colours. The composition is careful and proper. That''s what I felt made the photo look "normal" and ranked much lower than it is.  It took a while before I associated the photo with the topic lines. And I think that I have a problem with my own photo too. Usually, the judges here would do a quick glance and place a vote especially when it''s a mega-large challenge like this one. :) You might want to post process it a little more .. just to have some fun and see if you can get a nice abstract.... I did not manage vote on this challenge, but it would have been a 6 for me.. :) CheersEric', '2006-07-26 20:51:04.000000', NULL, 0),
