(2667272, 364717, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Beautiful lines Deb! I love that there are just so many to look at. The wood floor plank lines lead you in. Then you sort of follow up the door frame lines and back towards the front. Then up and down the molding pieces and land on the rockers! Pure genius!</td>', 'Trading post...  Beautiful lines Deb! I love that there are just so many to look at. The wood floor plank lines lead you in. Then you sort of follow up the door frame lines and back towards the front. Then up and down the molding pieces and land on the rockers! Pure genius!', '2006-07-27 10:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2667294, 365611, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Not one of your better photos. The veins are so bright that they seem to be almost blinding. It really even stops you from wanting to look at the rest of the photo. The shades of green are very nice though.</td>', 'Trading post...   Not one of your better photos. The veins are so bright that they seem to be almost blinding. It really even stops you from wanting to look at the rest of the photo. The shades of green are very nice though.', '2006-07-27 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
