(2670671, 365219, 332, '<td valign="top">glad2badad:<br/>I''m traveling overseas and have had little time for going through the comments. Just got to a stable internet connection in Marseille with Orange. Hurray for Orange :) Have had time now to go through the comments properly. Thanks for reminding me :)<br/> <br/>Contrast commenters:<br/>I can see your point but I was going for the soft picture to minimize that cloud.</td>', 'glad2badad:I''m traveling overseas and have had little time for going through the comments. Just got to a stable internet connection in Marseille with Orange. Hurray for Orange :) Have had time now to go through the comments properly. Thanks for reminding me :) Contrast commenters:I can see your point but I was going for the soft picture to minimize that cloud.', '2006-07-28 05:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
