(2678715, 363421, 49326, '<td valign="top">What? just one comment. I think this photograph is rather uninteresting. I think it needs better subject or something that makes the traces a better subject. Anyways, I love the lighting and the post processing.</td>', 'What? just one comment. I think this photograph is rather uninteresting. I think it needs better subject or something that makes the traces a better subject. Anyways, I love the lighting and the post processing.', '2006-07-31 06:39:26.000000', NULL, 0),
