(2679435, 365219, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by arnit:</b></div><hr/><i>Contrast commenters:<br/>I can see your point but I was going for the soft picture to minimize that cloud. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Darn clouds anyway!  :P</td>', 'Originally posted by arnit:Contrast commenters:I can see your point but I was going for the soft picture to minimize that cloud.  Darn clouds anyway!  :P', '2006-07-31 10:55:13.000000', NULL, 0),
