(2826685, 363150, 48228, '<td valign="top">This has an unusual feeling and mood in this image, almost looks antique like. I really like that effect. I think this is one of your stronger images, so well done. All that you need to do to make this image pop more, is to turn the composition at right angles, to make it look like it is going up, like the title says.</td>', 'This has an unusual feeling and mood in this image, almost looks antique like. I really like that effect. I think this is one of your stronger images, so well done. All that you need to do to make this image pop more, is to turn the composition at right angles, to make it look like it is going up, like the title says.', '2006-09-12 05:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2845771, 365644, 55838, '<td valign="top">I''m suprised this didn''t score higher.  Still 46th out of 443 isn''t bad!  It''s gorgeous.  Love your edit of the sky and the composition is very interesting.  I was one of your seven "9" votes.  I would normally have commented on a vote that high during the challenge but was tied up that week.</td>', 'I''m suprised this didn''t score higher.  Still 46th out of 443 isn''t bad!  It''s gorgeous.  Love your edit of the sky and the composition is very interesting.  I was one of your seven "9" votes.  I would normally have commented on a vote that high during the challenge but was tied up that week.', '2006-09-18 19:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2848978, 365027, 30018, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it interesting that someone scores it a ''10'' in the comment, but you recieved no 10''s in your scoring.  Too bad, because this is a beautiful shot.  Nice lighting...maybe a tad yellow, but that could be okay as it gives it an ''old time'' feeling.</td>', 'Isn''t it interesting that someone scores it a ''10'' in the comment, but you recieved no 10''s in your scoring.  Too bad, because this is a beautiful shot.  Nice lighting...maybe a tad yellow, but that could be okay as it gives it an ''old time'' feeling.', '2006-09-19 22:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
