(3329655, 365785, 36499, '<td valign="top">awesome image! and now Im awefully curious about the set up.whats the BG and what was your lighting? If I were you I would "rework" this shot(removing the "third" reflection) and put it up for sale now that your a member<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'awesome image! and now Im awefully curious about the set up.whats the BG and what was your lighting? If I were you I would "rework" this shot(removing the "third" reflection) and put it up for sale now that your a member~~Cher~~', '2007-02-05 08:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
