(3461936, 364711, 43410, '<td valign="top">this was incredibly underrated.  how in the world was this a sub-6...<br/> <br/>great job as always.</td>', 'this was incredibly underrated.  how in the world was this a sub-6... great job as always.', '2007-03-14 19:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3491563, 364428, 63269, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, but it most certainly does give me the creeps! I think that only the master photographers can capture an emotion or feeling like that, and portray it so vividly to the viewer that they can partake in that emotion. And you certainly have captured an awesome (creepy!) feeling! If a beginner like ME manages that, it''s by sheer accident! :) Amazing shot!</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, but it most certainly does give me the creeps! I think that only the master photographers can capture an emotion or feeling like that, and portray it so vividly to the viewer that they can partake in that emotion. And you certainly have captured an awesome (creepy!) feeling! If a beginner like ME manages that, it''s by sheer accident! :) Amazing shot!', '2007-03-27 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3635378, 366040, 24454, '<td valign="top">There ya go is right!   This kind of picture is really artistic, and unique, and beckons you to know the story behind the art.  I like it too!  Very much!<br/> <br/></td>', 'There ya go is right!   This kind of picture is really artistic, and unique, and beckons you to know the story behind the art.  I like it too!  Very much! ', '2007-05-09 23:08:25.000000', NULL, 0);
