(4489562, 365262, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great picture; has confidence, technicality; could be a foster grant add. nice tone and great shot.</td>', 'Great picture; has confidence, technicality; could be a foster grant add. nice tone and great shot.', '2008-02-15 20:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4489568, 365960, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think that the symmetry here works brilliantly. the rope is perfectly placed; neatly coiled. This is the view that the person being transported sees as the ferryman stands behind and licks his proverbial chops.<br/>I like the cool vast negative space of teh water being slice with the warm toned hot boat.<br/> <br/>excellent work, as always.</td>', 'I think that the symmetry here works brilliantly. the rope is perfectly placed; neatly coiled. This is the view that the person being transported sees as the ferryman stands behind and licks his proverbial chops.I like the cool vast negative space of teh water being slice with the warm toned hot boat. excellent work, as always.', '2008-02-15 20:03:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4634843, 364083, 63269, '<td valign="top">So beautiful - the lighting is just exquisite.</td>', 'So beautiful - the lighting is just exquisite.', '2008-04-12 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
