(6529548, 366210, 62187, '<td valign="top">If <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=62187&amp;collection_id=37828" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Clark</a> were pictured drivin'' down this road, then it would have something special and different that would really add some ''ooomph'' to it...! };&gt;)<br/> <br/>Actually, I like it the way it is...very dark and foreboding...I have similar shots.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-07 21:47:19.</i></td>', 'If Clark were pictured drivin'' down this road, then it would have something special and different that would really add some ''ooomph'' to it...! };>) Actually, I like it the way it is...very dark and foreboding...I have similar shots.', '2011-09-05 21:54:11.000000', '2011-09-07 22:47:19.000000', 0),
